The releases (artists, titles, kinds, dates) come from MusicBrainz
(https://musicbrainz.org), the open music encyclopedia of the MetaBrainz
Foundation, through its public API (version 2). Its core data is in the
public domain (CC0). The covers shown in the widgets are downloaded from the
Cover Art Archive (https://coverartarchive.org), a project of MusicBrainz and
the Internet Archive, when a dashboard shows them: they belong to their
owners and none is part of this repository (the covers of the widget
illustrations are drawn by docs/illustrations/gen.mjs).

Optional sources of artists: the public listening statistics of ListenBrainz
(https://listenbrainz.org, MetaBrainz Foundation) and the top artists of a
Last.fm profile (https://www.last.fm/api), read with the API key of the user.

The files under test/fixtures are reduced copies of answers of these APIs,
kept only to test their reading.

